   "#36371"
  ]
 },
 "scope_notes": "Modifies validation to record and return missing parent txids on TX_MISSING_INPUTS failures, and updates both TxOrphanage and TxDownloadManager to handle these parents selectively.",
 "changed_since_previous": "Diff inspected; changes verified to include returning missing parents from validation PreChecks and corresponding unit, functional, and fuzz test additions.",
 "card": "This PR addresses four P2P opportunistic 1P1C relay and orphan handling vulnerabilities where a peer delivering an alternative parent variant (matching txid with altered or missing witness) can disrupt package relay. These bugs allow malicious or out-of-order peers to clear child transactions from the orphanage, cancel parent requests from honest announcers, or poison reject filters against confirmed or evicted transactions. The changes prevent these cross-peer cancellations and unblock invariant enforcement in PR #36371.",
